WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.062 --> 00:00:05.555
"Oh no!" Roxy cried.

2
00:00:05.556 --> 00:00:08.124
Groon was shaking.

3
00:00:08.125 --> 00:00:13.129
Old spaceships and other metal objects broke apart and floated up into the sky.

4
00:00:13.130 --> 00:00:16.149
The ground itself began to break apart.

5
00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:22.201
"Whoa!" Terrell jumped to avoid getting hit by a rusty barrel.

6
00:00:22.202 --> 00:00:27.735
Cozlin looked ill. "Did Dr. Odd really leave us?

7
00:00:27.736 --> 00:00:33.120
We can't get home—or anywhere—without him!"

8
00:00:33.121 --> 00:00:38.167
Wukong gulped. "This is bad."

9
00:00:38.168 --> 00:00:41.537
A million thoughts ran through Roxy's head.

10
00:00:41.538 --> 00:00:45.699
"This planet is falling apart," she thought.

11
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:49.018
"I'll be trapped here, floating in outer space!

12
00:00:49.019 --> 00:00:54.160
And worse than that—I brought Terrell here! And Wukong!

13
00:00:54.161 --> 00:01:01.365
They'll be stuck here, millions of light-years from home! And it's all my fault!"

14
00:01:01.366 --> 00:01:05.237
But the thing that bothered Roxy the most was Dr. Odd.

15
00:01:05.238 --> 00:01:10.424
"I shouldn't have trusted him!" she thought.

16
00:01:10.425 --> 00:01:13.770
Suddenly a spaceship appeared just above them.

17
00:01:13.771 --> 00:01:17.541
A hatch opened, revealing a figure inside.

18
00:01:17.542 --> 00:01:20.863
"Dr. Odd!" Roxy cried.

19
00:01:20.864 --> 00:01:25.341
"Get in!" he shouted. "Quickly!"

20
00:01:25.342 --> 00:01:30.204
Everyone jumped into the spaceship.

21
00:01:30.205 --> 00:01:36.044
Dr. Odd grabbed the controls and flew up into space.

22
00:01:36.045 --> 00:01:40.954
"You probably thought I left you behind," Dr. Odd said.

23
00:01:40.955 --> 00:01:45.014
"The magnetic field went down, and my moon drifted off Groon.

24
00:01:45.015 --> 00:01:48.091
The planet's orbit is filled with debris.

25
00:01:48.092 --> 00:01:54.130
It took me a while to navigate back down to the surface."

26
00:01:54.131 --> 00:01:58.989
He flew past pieces of old rockets and satellites.

27
00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:05.367
Soon they were all back inside the moon.

28
00:02:05.368 --> 00:02:10.546
They sat in an observation room, and Dr. Odd brought out tea and snacks.

29
00:02:10.547 --> 00:02:17.553
Through a large window, they watched as more objects drifted away from Groon.

30
00:02:17.554 --> 00:02:20.782
Cozlin made a call to Delkor.

31
00:02:20.783 --> 00:02:26.611
She breathed a huge sigh of relief. "Good

32
00:02:26.612 --> 00:02:28.177
news, everyone. All

33
00:02:28.178 --> 00:02:31.389
the robots on Delkor stopped working. My

34
00:02:31.390 --> 00:02:35.764
planet is safe." Roxy

35
00:02:35.765 --> 00:02:41.437
called Mayor Bloom and found out that Metro City was also safe. "What

36
00:02:41.438 --> 00:02:45.452
about that huge demon?" Wukong asked. "You

37
00:02:45.453 --> 00:02:48.632
mean Meltron?" Cozlin said. "He's

38
00:02:48.633 --> 00:02:51.285
a robot, not a demon. He

39
00:02:51.286 --> 00:02:55.515
probably got destroyed inside Groon by now." Roxy

40
00:02:55.516 --> 00:03:01.174
nodded. "He was practically falling apart when he escaped." Terrell

41
00:03:01.175 --> 00:03:05.640
smiled. "Good!" Cozlin

42
00:03:05.641 --> 00:03:10.072
looked out the window. "What

43
00:03:10.073 --> 00:03:16.929
will happen to Groon?" she asked. "Will it be destroyed?" "I

44
00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:20.680
wish I knew," Dr. Odd said. "But

45
00:03:20.681 --> 00:03:25.774
even if it is, at least the Groonians aren't stranded on it. They

46
00:03:25.775 --> 00:03:35.683
left long ago. I hope they're safe—wherever they are." "Maybe

47
00:03:35.684 --> 00:03:41.753
the planet will be okay," Roxy said. "Look!" More

48
00:03:41.754 --> 00:03:48.546
chunks of metal and old machinery left Groon's surface, exposing spots of green. "Those

49
00:03:48.547 --> 00:03:52.459
are trees!" Wukong said. Dr.

50
00:03:52.460 --> 00:04:00.099
Odd nodded. "I believe Groon's forests will be able to restore themselves." Cozlin

51
00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:03.151
looked around at everyone. "I

52
00:04:03.152 --> 00:04:09.129
used to like working alone. But our team is pretty cool." "It

53
00:04:09.130 --> 00:04:15.071
sure is!" Terrell said. "What should we call ourselves?" Dr.

54
00:04:15.072 --> 00:04:21.489
Odd tapped his chin. "You should call yourselves the Galaxy Squad." "No,

55
00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:28.240
Dr. Odd," Roxy said. " We should call ourselves the Galaxy Squad.

56
00:04:28.241 --> 00:04:30.640
You're a part of this team."

57
00:04:30.641 --> 00:04:33.763
Dr. Odd smiled.

58
00:04:33.764 --> 00:04:37.568
"Now I'm a part of two teams," Wukong said.

59
00:04:37.569 --> 00:04:42.154
"I like my other team, but one member is really lazy.

60
00:04:42.155 --> 00:04:46.221
You guys all work pretty hard."

61
00:04:46.222 --> 00:04:53.503
Terrell gulped. "Our work isn't done." He pointed out the window.

62
00:04:53.504 --> 00:05:03.906
"Meltron wasn't destroyed. He's escaping!"

